## What changed from the previous version

The **Timestamp (original)** column (F in the Final sheet) now carries the raw string from column A of whichever row the script chose as the primary (most recent), rather than the parsed date. The **Raw Timestamp** through **Raw PreferredPark** columns (I–N) append the full original A:F values from that primary row so you can always cross-reference. Phone values that resolved to 10 digits are written as `(555) 123-4567`; anything else passes through unchanged. And the summary block now includes a park breakdown section between the totals and the data header, so you can see at a glance how volunteers distribute across locations.

